# APP_NAME

A high-performance decentralized mobile application built with [Pear Expo Starter](https://github.com/AmreshVs/expo-bare-template).

This project uses **Pear Technology** and **Bare Runtime** for decentralized backend logic and **Expo** for the frontend.

## 🏁 Getting Started

### 1. Install Dependencies
```bash
npm install
```

### 2. Generate Backend Bundle
```bash
npm run bare-bundle
```

### 3. Run the App
```bash
# Android
npm run android

# iOS
npm run ios
```

## 🏗 Project Structure
- `app/`: Frontend (React Native / Expo)
- `backend/`: Backend (Bare Runtime)
- `spec/`: HRPC Schemas
- `utils/`: RPC & Worklet Utilities

## 🧼 Code Quality
- `npm run lint`: Linting with ESLint
- `npm run format`: Formatting with Prettier (no semicolons)
